      "review_summary": "The PR changes the Codex app-server projector so read-only `commandExecution` items can be marked replay-safe and adds a runtime contract test for read-only versus mutating shell commands.\n\nPR surface: Source +1, Tests +43. Total +44 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main always records Codex `commandExecution` as side-effecting, while the linked issue and tests exercise read-only command turns; I did not run a live strict-agentic scenario in this read-only review.",
