      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(codex): classify commandExecution mutability via shared isMutatingToolCall",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #101890 — strict-agentic retry cannot retry terminal turns that only\nperformed read-only shell commands because `isMutatingNativeToolItem` always\ntreats `commandExecution` items as mutating.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`isMutatingNativeToolItem` returns `true` for all `commandExecution` items,\neven read-only commands (grep, ls, rg, cat).\n\n## Fix\n\nUse `isMutatingToolCall(\"exec\", itemToolArgs(item))` in\n`isMutatingNativeToolItem` instead of `return true`. Imported from the\nexisting internal module (no new SDK API surface).\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Runtime Proof (Codex Event Projector)\n\nThe regression test exercises the production `CodexAppServerEventProjector`\nwith real `turn/completed` notifications:\n\n```\n✓ rg TODO src/agents     → replaySafe: true\n✓ grep -r foo .          → replaySafe: true\n✓ ls -la                 → replaySafe: true\n✓ cat package.json       → replaySafe: true\n✓ echo hello > /tmp/out  → replaySafe: false\n✓ rm -rf /tmp/cache      → replaySafe: false\n✓ npm install            → replaySafe: false\n```\n\nFull chain: `isMutatingNativeToolItem → isSideEffectingNativeToolItem →\nrecordToolMeta → sideEffectingToolItemIds → hadPotentialSideEffects →\nreplayMetadata`.\n\n### Autoreview (claude-sonnet-5)\n\n→ patch is correct (0.98), no accepted/actionable findings\n\n### Test Results\n\n- SDK surface: 9/9 passed\n- Codex projector: 7/7 passed (command classification)\n\n- [x] oxfmt + oxlint pass\n- [x] No new SDK API surface\n- [x] autoreview clean (0.98)",
